Monado (forks/monado, branch omarchyvr at 78237e1b3): the Pimax driver also takes the Crystal Super (USB 34a4:0040,
the Dream Air protocol, analysis/crystal-super-capture-20261017.md) and names the headset after its USB id.
Apply in forks/monado: git apply ../../linux/crystal-super/monado-crystal-super.patch

